{"publicId":"873cc9f1-7d3d-4120-a765-f5dd83c82dea","title":"阿斯利康肿瘤业务增速超Farxiga销售降幅","status":"active","reportCount":1,"sourceCount":1,"firstReportAt":"2026-11-11T14:38:17.000Z","latestAt":"2026-11-11T14:38:17.000Z","digest":"阿斯利康2026年第三季度肿瘤业务同比增长超20%，而糖尿病药物Farxiga同期销售额下降约15%。报道指出肿瘤业务增长主要源于新药Trastuzumab deruxtecan的全球推广，而Farxiga因诺和诺德新型药物Ozempic 2.0竞争及专利到期导致份额流失。\n\n市场分析认为，肿瘤业务超20%的增速将部分抵消Farxiga销售额下滑对阿斯利康2026财年营收的影响，但需关注Ozempic 2.0的持续竞争压力。","digestUpdatedAt":"2026-11-11T16:59:41.257Z","summary":null,"excerpt":null,"latest":"阿斯利康肿瘤业务增长快于 Farxiga 销售下滑","latestReport":{"id":"c8tm89x0ertbyor8kj2k9awry"},"whyHot":{"participants48h":1,"newParticipants6h":0,"recentReports24h":1,"observationComplete":true,"rank":null},"developments":[{"factId":"frz799YAP5zM","title":"阿斯利康肿瘤业务增长快于 Farxiga 销售下滑","firstReportAt":"2026-11-11T14:38:17.000Z","reportCount":1,"representative":{"id":"c8tm89x0ertbyor8kj2k9awry","title":"阿斯利康肿瘤业务增长快于 Farxiga 销售下滑","summary":"阿斯利康的肿瘤业务增长速度超过了 Farxiga 销售的下滑。","source":{"name":"Seeking Alpha","firstParty":false},"publishedAt":"2026-11-11T14:38:17.000Z","selected":false}}],"officialReports":[],"timeline":[{"id":"c8tm89x0ertbyor8kj2k9awry","title":"阿斯利康肿瘤业务增长快于 Farxiga 销售下滑","summary":"阿斯利康的肿瘤业务增长速度超过了 Farxiga 销售的下滑。","source":{"name":"Seeking Alpha","firstParty":false},"publishedAt":"2026-11-11T14:38:17.000Z","selected":false}],"heat":[{"hour":"2026-11-11T17:00:00.000Z","heat":9.3,"participants":1},{"hour":"2026-11-11T19:00:00.000Z","heat":8.8,"participants":1},{"hour":"2026-11-11T20:00:00.000Z","heat":8.6,"participants":1},{"hour":"2026-11-11T21:00:00.000Z","heat":8.3,"participants":1},{"hour":"2026-11-11T22:00:00.000Z","heat":8.1,"participants":1},{"hour":"2026-11-11T23:00:00.000Z","heat":7.9,"participants":1},{"hour":"2026-11-12T00:00:00.000Z","heat":7.6,"participants":1}],"related":[],"topics":[{"slug":"research","name":"研究报告"},{"slug":"opinions","name":"观点"},{"slug":"howto","name":"教程与避坑"}]}